          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP438 Police Outpost Provincial Park&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Posted: N49° 00.394' W113° 27.980'

My GPSr: N49° 00.39[b]6[/b]' W113° 27.980'&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This one was found after an adventurous drive along packed gravel roads, the kind where you can see if any oncoming vehicles from miles away. After getting close and parking in the small lot near the cap, I made my way first along the hiking trail and then beelined up the hill to the cap. The view from here is better than the “official” spot at the parking lot.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
